  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Áp dụng định lí cô-sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>549</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>549</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>61</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>26</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>26</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>34</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Diện tích của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
